    "counters": [],
    "adapt": "A hostless plot on the Highstone hill flank: no building, so the kit never turns. Every row rests on the probed ground (`--terrain`). The iron ore face of Coalman's Brow without its office: nine granite boulders in two tiers close the uphill side and four iron rocks lie at their foot (two spots are trees); a loaded ore cart, a pick pile and a lantern stand on the apron, sawn timber stacks flank the face, two flood lamps light the row, a wooden fence closes both sides and the sign stands on the road side. Mining level 12 opens it; there is no job desk, furnace or buyer here (the iron chain goes on to the smelter and the dock). Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
  },
